      114.22,
      542.53,
      247.29
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, Minister of Justice, Public Administration, Home Affairs, Provincial Councils, Local Government and Labour do by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4 (1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Act Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes - Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint of Mr. Obadage Leelarathne, Attorney-at-Law of No. 242, Sri Sobitha Mawatha, Nagoda, Kalutara to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration. DR. HARINI AMARASURIYA, Minister of Justice, Public Administration, Home Affairs, Provincial Councils, Local Government and Labour.",
